{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1717","id":4139973318,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p872wvrG","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1717","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1717.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1717.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1717","number":1717,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Wire exact KG v0 evidence readback into product boundary","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nIssue #1716 requires one bounded product/API consumer over the merged KG v0 structural release from #1714 / PR #1715. This PR adds an authenticated GET consumer that resolves an exact `question_id`, retrieves its ordered QuestionPart owner hierarchy, selects a QuestionPart, and returns exact QP/MS EvidenceAnchor identity, source metadata, hashes, and logical evidence references.\n\nThe read path is registered at the canonical gateway:\n\n```text\nGET /api/learning/questions/kg-v0-readback\n```\n\nSemantic fields remain explicitly unavailable because the admitted KG release contains zero semantic nodes and edges:\n\n```text\nsemantic_status = unavailable\nquestion_type = null\nprocedure_model = null\nprocedure_steps = []\n```\n\nNo candidate semantic object is promoted or exposed as approved truth.\n\n## Product read path\n\nThe Stage 1 release manifest, nodes, and edges remain the only runtime authority. The checked-in `readback.json` is test-backed proof only and is never used for runtime lookup.\n\nEach uncached runtime lookup runs release authentication, parsing, validation, and indexing in a one-shot worker thread. This keeps synchronous reads and full-corpus indexing off the request event loop and releases the corpus after extracting the requested response. Full-corpus workers are globally serialized with a maximum concurrency of one; identical in-flight requests are deduplicated. The main process retains only compact response projections in a cache bounded to 16 entries and a five-minute TTL.\n\nArbitrary exact Question lookup remains supported. The offline proof generator explicitly uses the full-release validation path and continues to reproduce the checked-in proof byte-for-byte.\n\nThe formal fixture proves:\n\n```text\nqrow_9709_m16_qp_12_q01\n→ qrow_9709_m16_qp_12_q01::q01/i\n→ eanchor::8d565443... (QP)\n→ eanchor::ae32071b... (MS)\n```\n\nThe implementation performs no provider/model calls, semantic mutation, structural authority writes, remote data writes, KG expansion, RAG, database access, screenshots, or PDF extraction.\n\n## Authority and custody\n\n- Parent: #1713\n- Stage 1 child: #1714\n- Stage 1 PR: #1715\n- Stage 2 child: #1716\n- Exact starting `origin/main`: `fca6fbc715f0d0a08d285d083eeacdf24dc743d8`\n- Exact starting tree: `fe505090fabcf2fdba130f3824f11aec36b32316`\n- Reviewed Stage 1 head: `340edb6f5a371711a2820d4d5e24ca33eeb574a4`\n- Exact Stage 1 release manifest SHA-256: `baba4892a3079cc1a0d4fd6f698c9bbd9cfe59dce1a3b881cd08f3e1843d22c0`\n- Current head: `754417855f3c38569bb5c32a9576d34800ce374a`\n- Current tree: `bde77e9934b76c41753de42caaf498db3036951e`\n- Changed files: 12\n- Active readback artifacts: 1 (12,101 bytes; proof-only and unchanged by review repairs)\n\n## Runtime diagnostic\n\nOne cold exact lookup over the admitted Stage 1 release:\n\n```text\nelapsed_ms = 277\nmaximum_event_loop_heartbeat_gap_ms = 6\nrss_before_mb = 47\nrss_after_worker_exit_and_gc_mb = 61\nactive_full_corpus_worker_count = 0\npeak_active_full_corpus_worker_count = 1\nfull_corpus_documents_cached = false\n```\n\nThe focused concurrency regression issues three distinct cache misses plus one identical duplicate. It proves three worker starts, peak concurrency one, one deduplicated request, and zero active/queued/in-flight work after completion.\n\n## Hard completion gates\n\n```text\nkg_release_manifest_authenticated = PASS\nexact_question_lookup = PASS\nquestion_part_hierarchy_readback = PASS\nexact_qp_evidence_readback = PASS\nexact_ms_evidence_readback = PASS\ncandidate_as_approved_count = 0\nstale_kg_release_reference_count = 0\nmissing_edge_endpoint_count = 0\nsemantic_truth_mutation_count = 0\nstructural_authority_write_count = 0\nprovider_call_count = 0\nremote_data_write_count = 0\nsemantic_unavailable_is_fail_closed = true\n```\n\n## Verification\n\n- Stage 2 API/service tests — 16/16 passed\n- canonical API gateway integration tests — 10/10 passed\n- route registry contract/policy/collision tests — 22/22 passed\n- combined current-head focused Jest matrix — 48/48 passed\n- `node scripts/vlm/issue_1716_kg_v0_product_readback.mjs --check` — byte-identical readback passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1714_kg_v0_structural_materialization.py --validate-only` — authenticated predecessor release passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1714_kg_v0_structural_materialization.test.py` — 15/15 passed\n- pinned ESLint over every changed JS/MJS file — passed\n- `git diff --check` — passed\n- post-repair preflight — expected three-file repair classified; artifact guard and A+ ratchet healthy\n\nThe governed task worktree intentionally has no `node_modules`; verification used the repository-root pinned Jest and ESLint binaries without installing dependencies or invoking `npx`.\n\nCloses #1716\n","created_at":"2026-07-27T06:44:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T07:48:30Z","closed_at":"2026-07-27T07:48:29Z","merged_at":"2026-07-27T07:48:29Z","merge_commit_sha":"099468b9e63112475281e7c8ed5b0f975121eeb0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1717/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1717/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1717/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/754417855f3c38569bb5c32a9576d34800ce374a","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1716-kg-v0-product-readback","ref":"task/1716-kg-v0-product-readback","sha":"754417855f3c38569bb5c32a9576d34800ce374a","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen